  "post_title": "Debat a Suera sobre l'Estat del Benestar",
  "post_date": "2013-11-24 10:51:33",
  "post_name": "debat-a-suera-sobre-lestat-del-benestar",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Noticias|Política|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>El F&ograve;rum C&iacute;vic de Debat ha organitzat durant tot aquest dissabte a Suera una jornada al voltant de l&#39;Estat del Benestar, en la qual han participat representants de diverses formacions pol&iacute;tiques i activistes socials.</p>\n<p>Ha obert la jornada el president del F&ograve;rum, J.J. Arrandis, per a donar pas a Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garc&iacute;a, alcalde de Suera i fil&ograve;sof, que ha fet una introducci&oacute; a l&#39;Estat del Benestar i ha exposat les cr&iacute;tiques al mateix des de diferents &agrave;mbits.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/11/IMG_2724.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Despr&eacute;s ha hagut una primera taula redona sobre el tema general de la jornada: L&#39;Estat del Benestar, sols per a alguns? Moderada pel regidor de Comprom&iacute;s a l&#39;Ajuntament de Benic&agrave;ssim,&nbsp;Domingo Ferrando, han intervingut Enric Nomdedeu, regidor a l&#39;Ajuntament de Castell&oacute;&nbsp;i portaveu de Comprom&iacute;s a&nbsp;la Diputaci&oacute; de Castell&oacute;, i I&ntilde;aki Vallejo, representant del partit alternatiu&nbsp;X a Castell&oacute;.</p>\n<p>Moderats per&nbsp;Pedro Gozalbo, activista social,&nbsp;Antonio Lorenzo, membre de l&#39;executiva nacional del PSPV-PSOE,&nbsp;i Alejandro Moreno, regidor d&#39;EUPV a l&#39;Ajuntament de Vila-real, han obert el debat sobre l&#39;Estat del Benestar, caritat o just&iacute;cia social?, despr&eacute;s d&#39;un dinar a l&#39;Hotel Verdi&agrave;.</p>\n<p>Tant de mat&iacute; com de vesprada, ha hagut participaci&oacute; de les altres persones assistents, entre les qual hi havia dos germans de Guinea Equatorial, estudiants de Ci&egrave;ncies Pol&iacute;tiques i Dret a la Universitat de Val&egrave;ncia. En totes les intervencions s&#39;ha insistit en la necessitat de&nbsp;mantindre l&#39;Estat del Benestar, amena&ccedil;at per les pol&iacute;tiques conservadores com a conseq&uuml;&egrave;ncia de la crisi. La jornada s&#39;ha tancat amb un recital a c&agrave;rrec del poeta d&#39;Onda Javi Aguilella.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2724.jpg\" alt=\"img_2724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2725.jpg\" alt=\"img_2725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2726.jpg\" alt=\"img_2726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2727.jpg\" alt=\"img_2727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2728.jpg\" alt=\"img_2728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2729.jpg\" alt=\"img_2729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2730.jpg\" alt=\"img_2730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2731.jpg\" alt=\"img_2731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2732.jpg\" alt=\"img_2732\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2733.jpg\" alt=\"img_2733\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2735.jpg\" alt=\"img_2735\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2736.jpg\" alt=\"img_2736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2737.jpg\" alt=\"img_2737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2738.jpg\" alt=\"img_2738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2740.jpg\" alt=\"img_2740\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2741.jpg\" alt=\"img_2741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2742.jpg\" alt=\"img_2742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2743.jpg\" alt=\"img_2743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2746.jpg\" alt=\"img_2746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/img_2749.jpg\" alt=\"img_2749\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/vesprada1.jpg\" alt=\"vesprada1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/vesprada2.jpg\" alt=\"vesprada2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadaestatbenestarsuera/vesprada3.jpg\" alt=\"vesprada3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
